  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iNG1TLm.png\" width=\"945\" height=\"116\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>功能特点：</strong></span></p>\n<p>Minecraft 字体看起来怪怪的？</p>\n<p>这个包将会修复它！</p>\n<p>基于 Faithful 32 纹理包（但经过修改）</p>\n<p>但是仅适用于 Minecraft 字体（文字、数字等）</p>\n<p>支持所有版本！</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>注意：</strong></span></p>\n<p>支持模组</p>\n<p>欢迎将此纹理包添加到您的模组包中</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">示例：</strong></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/457/256/310/172/2.png\" width=\"404\" height=\"185\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">更多图片请访问：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-font/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">图片</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">感谢大家超过一百万次下载！</span></strong></span></p>",
